# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Environment variables for the Spider-Man GitHub Profile Generator
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# This app is 100% client-side — no server secrets needed.
# The GitHub API calls happen in the browser against api.github.com.
#
# The ONLY optional env var is for the Cloudflare Worker badge service.
# Without it, the generator uses the default shared worker.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Cloudflare Worker (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Your worker URL for live badge mode. If unset, uses the default shared worker.
# VITE_WORKER_BASE=YOUR WORKER_URL

# ── Analytics (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VITE_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
